    {"eyebrow": "Why It's Different", "heading": "Restoration Marketing Runs on Speed and Relationships", "paragraphs": ["Most restoration work comes from two places: homeowners searching in a panic, and referral partners like plumbers, insurance agents and property managers who send you jobs. A marketing system for a restoration company has to win both, and they need very different things.", "Emergency searchers need to reach a real person in minutes, any hour of the day. Referral partners need to trust that you'll show up, keep their client updated and make them look good for sending you. Everything we build below serves one of those two sources."]},
